  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The discovery of this new vein of what appears to be natural tritanium on the third planet of the Rigel Minoris system gives us the perfect chance to attempt an Uplifting. For those among the Kirhosi elite that are not aware, an Uplifting is when we elect to take a minor species and speed up their introduction to the galactic community. We offer them goods and technology in exchange for their resources, and both benefit. As an added bonus, later down the line, we have a valuable new trade partner that may speak on our behalf in the Protectorate Assembly.",
    "value": "参宿七增三系统第三行星上新发现的天然三相合金矿脉，为我们实施“助长计划”提供了绝佳契机。对于不了解此计划的鼠族精英而言，助长计划即是我们选定一个较落后种族，加速其融入星际社会的进程。我们向其提供商品与技术，以换取他们的资源，达成互利共赢。更长远来看，未来我们将获得一个重要贸易伙伴，他们或可在守护团大会上代表我方发言。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "How this particular group of Fenerox came to be here is unknown, but they show a capacity above and beyond their kin found on other worlds for technology and language. This has given them a head-start already, and we estimate they will have reached the stars on their own within 200 years anyhow. We will send a ship to help them along in 8 solar cycles. This should give our traders time to prepare sufficient resources to offer them. Hopefully they will be willing to trade their valuable Tritanium, as it will prove exceptionally valuable in fashioning a new line of FTL drives for Ark Fleet Cassini.",
    "value": "目前尚不清楚这批耳廓狐族群是如何抵达此地的，但他们在科技与语言方面展现出超越其他世界同族的能力。这已使他们具备先发优势，据我们估算，即便没有外界干预，他们也能在200年内自主进入星际时代。我们将在8个太阳周期内派遣飞船予以协助，这也为我们的贸易商留出足够时间筹备可提供的资源。希望他们愿意交易珍贵的三相合金矿，该材料对卡西尼方舟舰队建造新一代超光速驱动器产业链具有极高价值。"
